    ('sk-b2bsales', 'dom-cust', 'CUST-02', 'AI-powered marketing & sales', 'Applies AI to segmentation, lead scoring and offer design.', true, true, '["Level 1 · Aware: understands concepts and vocabulary; applies with close guidance.","Level 2 · Practising: applies the skill in routine situations in own role with occasional support.","Level 3 · Proficient: applies independently in complex situations and coaches peers.","Level 4 · Leading: sets standards, redesigns work around the skill and delivers measured impact."]'::jsonb),
